msgctxt "@info:shell %1 is what was given; auto, cpu, batch and opengl stay as they are"
msgid "Not a way of painting: %1 (auto, cpu, batch or opengl)"
msgstr "不是一种绘制方式：%1（auto、cpu、batch 或 opengl）"

